  "referenceNumber": "RUS1120",
  "remarks": "\nSergei Sergeevich IVANOV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following grounds: (1) IVANOV has been \ninvolved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director or equivalent, of PJSC Alrosa, a Government of Russia-affiliated entity; (2) IVANOV has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director or equivalent, of PJSC Alrosa, a business in the Russian extractives sector, a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia; (3) Sergei Sergeevich IVANOV is associated with Sergey Borisovich IVANOV (an involved person) by being an immediate family member,  namely Sergey Borisovich IVANOV’s child. \n",
